ed-world protocol.\\\\n- Title selected by secrets.randbelow from 50 private candidates: '+title+'.\\\\n- Development folder: \"'`'\"'+base+'\"'`. Shipping HTML and exit-interview.json belong in workspace root.'\"\\\\n- Next: vendor contracts, native physics/animation spike, shared simulation, procedural art and UI.\\\\n')\nprint(base)\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"Beauty-and-the-Tall-Tale-Beauty-and-the-Beast-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261106-044024\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
