{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_124","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('../PROGRESS.md');p.write_text(p.read_text()+'''\\\\n## Last UI correctness fixes\\\\n\\\\n- Standalone packaged browser suite44/44 now passes, including actual native-input full solo rescue/ending and explicit co-op visible regroup countdown plus safe timeout/carry.\\\\n- Fixed missing regroup timer presentation; no rule/timing change.\\\\n- Cosmetic powered-clear payoff now says BONK instead of +50, because repeat pressure instances do not award another encounter reward. Results explain first-encounter rewards. This preserves the anti-farming ledger and makes feedback truthful.\\\\n- Fixed game issue ledger now30 distinct issues,4 critical; feedback updated. No production network/rule/balance changes during the clock investigation. Runtime sources are frozen.\\\\n- Independent simulation review confirms the synchronized browser driver uses normal intentions and native fixed-step accumulation, without rule mutation or hidden cheats. Hub agent’s synchronized3-route smoke passed with zero frame-clock skew; final4-route proof includes a fresh degraded repeat and measured delivery-delay bounds.\\\\n''')\nPY\npython3 - <<'PY'\nimport json\nfrom pathlib import Path\nx=json.loads(Path('artifacts/defects.json').read_text());print('Defect ledger:',len(x),'fixed;',sum(r['severity']=='critical'for r in x),'critical')\nx=json.loads(Path('artifacts/hub-rescue.json').read_text());print('Current Hub report:',len(x),'scenarios,',[r['pass']for r in x])\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
