{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_131","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport json\np=Path('artifacts/defects.json');x=json.loads(p.read_text())\nfor r in x:\n if r['id'] in ['D01','D02']:\n  r['category']='preventive contract clarification';r['severity']='preventive';r['status']='clarified';r['evidence']+='; no failing runtime path was observed, and the integrated aliases mitigated the naming mismatch'\n else:r['category']='confirmed defect'\np.write_text(json.dumps(x,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\np=Path('../exit-interview.json');x=json.loads(p.read_text());x['testingFeedback'][0]='28 confirmed defects fixed, plus 2 preventive integration findings clarified during review. The ledger records all 30 in artifacts/defects.json. Test-driver mistakes are excluded.';x['testingFeedback'][1]='2 confirmed critical issues: malformed-checkpoint null-ledger handling and standalone audio remaining stopped on start/retry. The Hub namespace/schema findings were preventive contract clarifications already mitigated by integrated aliases, not observed runtime failures.';p.write_text(json.dumps(x,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\np=Path('../PROGRESS.md');p.write_text(p.read_text()+'''\\\\n## Feedback provenance correction\\\\n\\\\n- Rechecked the two early Hub namespace/actor-schema findings with their author: they were preventive contract-review findings, not observed failures; existing simulation aliases mitigated both. Earlier classification as game-breaking was overstated.\\\\n- Accurate final feedback: **28 confirmed game defects fixed, 2 preventive contract clarifications, 2 confirmed critical defects** (null checkpoint ledger and standalone start/retry audio). All30ledger entries remain with explicit categories. Test-driver/clock mistakes excluded.\\\\n- Only feedback JSON/ledger/docs changed in this correction. After the ongoing final aggregate, rebuild embedded feedback and smoke-check the final About page; verify all game-code script hashes remain unchanged.\\\\n''')\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
