{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_136","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"python3 - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport json,hashlib,re\nroot=Path.cwd();ident=json.loads((root/'build-identity.json').read_text());shipping=root.parent/(ident['basename']+'.html');html=shipping.read_text();interview=json.loads((root.parent/'exit-interview.json').read_text());embedded=json.loads(re.search(r'window.__TT_META=(.*?);window.__TT_ID=',html,re.S).group(1));assert interview==embedded\nreports={}\nfor name in ['rules-report.json','network-routes.json','browser-checks.json','audio-checks.json','controls-checks.json','hub-checks.json','hub-rescue.json']:\n data=json.loads((root/'artifacts'/name).read_text())\n if isinstance(data,list):\n  assert all(r['pass']for r in data),name\n  reports[name]={'passed':len(data),'total':len(data)}\n else:\n  assert not data['failures'],name\n  reports[name]={'passed':data['count'],'total':data['count']}\naggregate=json.loads((root/'artifacts/verification.json').read_text());assert all(r['pass']for r in aggregate)\nledger=json.loads((root/'artifacts/defects.json').read_text());assert len(ledger)==31;assert sum(x['category']=='confirmed defect'for x in ledger)==29;assert sum(x['severity']=='critical'for x in ledger)==2\nmanifest={'title':ident['title'],'shippingFile':shipping.name,'sha256':hashlib.sha256(shipping.read_bytes()).hexdigest(),'bytes':shipping.stat().st_size,'interview':'exit-interview.json','aggregateCommand':'npm run --silent verify','aggregateResult':f'{len(aggregate)}/{len(aggregate)} checks passed','finalBrowserResult':'46/46 checks passed (includes two added terminal-navigation regressions)','reports':reports,'confirmedDefectsFixed':29,'preventiveContractClarifications':2,'confirmedCriticalDefectsFixed':2,'physicalDeviceTesting':'unknown','humanListening':'unknown','humanFirstRunPacing':'unknown'}\n(root/'artifacts/release-manifest.json').write_text(json.dumps(manifest,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\np=root.parent/'PROGRESS.md';s=p.read_text();s=s.replace('# Build progress','# Build progress\\\\n\\\\n**Status: complete.** Open the shipping HTML in this folder’s root. Final feedback: 29 confirmed defects fixed, 2 preventive contract clarifications, 2 confirmed critical defects.');s+='''\\\\n## Complete handoff\\\\n\\\\n- Final single-file HTML and exit-interview.json are present at the required workspace root. Embedded feedback exactly matches the JSON. Metadata, attribution and source year are consistent.\\\\n- \"'`npm run --silent verify` finished **161/161 passing**. The final targeted browser pass finished **46/46**, including two subsequently added terminal Close/Back regressions. The default verifier includes these two checks for subsequent runs. No failing checks remain.'\"\\\\n- Current reports: rules47/47; network units10/10 and simulated routes3/3; presentation9/9; packaged browsers46/46; actual audio17/17; controls17/17; upstream harness5/5; synchronized packaged network rescues4/4. Last two browser regressions cover closing victory/failure safely to title.\\\\n- Four packaged Hub rescues include normal, degraded, a fresh degraded repeat and server hosting after helper departure. Clock skew0; measured degraded delivery100–200ms; real bridge/session traffic, ordinary intentions, default balance, no invulnerability, shared terminal objectives/ledger and quiet end cleanup.\\\\n- Inspected final title/gameplay/co-op/phone, window/Hank strips, rooftop, departure-fixed and results compositions. The plane caption is fully readable.\\\\n- \"'`artifacts/release-manifest.json` records shipping SHA256, size and evidence. All owned browsers and servers are closed. No further game work remains.'\"\\\\n- Limits stated honestly in credits/interview: physical devices, human first-run pacing and subjective listening are unknown. Usage remains exactly added on import.\\\\n''';p.write_text(s)\nprint(manifest['aggregateResult']);print('Final browser: 46/46; all evidence green.');print('Shipping HTML and interview validated.')\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
